{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_st04",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_st04",
  "title": "海浪照常拍岸",
  "storyCode": "DH-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4a4d6aef4ae2ef2d6eeaee3dd2059b21d0ee466e9bb63a0dcc7ff4b2ef4f0f1a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "你終於醒了，D.D.D.。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "怎麼了，睡完覺醒過來不是很正常的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "但你昨天回來之後倒頭就睡，搞得我有點害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "......現在外面是什麼情況？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "如果你是問城裡的狀況的話，和之前沒什麼差別，一樣的喧鬧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "我去吃早飯的時候聽到很多人在討論昨天的事，但是他們也都不怎麼在乎的感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "畢竟事情已經被沖淡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "坎黛拉市長真是個厲害人物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "在昨天那種情況下，居然會用那樣的方式......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "我當時在電視前也震驚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "那種鎮場的方式，真的是聞所未聞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "而且還真的有不少人去和那些危險分子戰鬥了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "我當時就在旁邊，那種感覺，真是太奇妙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士的不遠處，是想要拼命衝過來殺掉她的危險分子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "而坎黛拉女士對此卻不屑一顧，她只關心無人機有沒有靠近遊輪，能否看到船上的情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "她就站在那裡，對著螢幕和海面指指點點，一邊和旁邊的人說笑著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "在那一刻，正在發生的一切彷彿都是不真實的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "最後，那兩位女俠出現了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "她們的出現又將一切拉回了現實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "這真是......這真是太刺激了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "所以你想創作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "啊哈哈，不愧是你，真瞭解我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "text": "你以為我們認識了多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "是的，我要創作，我要將此時此刻的害怕、感激、迷茫都記錄下來，作成一首歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "這首歌為我自己而作，但與她們有關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "這座城市雖然還挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "萊塔尼亞的歌劇，哥倫比亞的電影，還有玻利瓦爾的咖啡，之前想要體驗的東西都體驗到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "不過，這座城市裡的人還真是無聊，比賽過半就不想跟他們玩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "要是早知道最後會變成這樣，中途確認陳姐姐沒事後應該和她一起上船的，這樣應該能多幫上她的忙吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "算啦，反正這座城市也差不多玩膩了，看一看陳姐姐她們會去哪裡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "陳姐姐來的地方，肯定也有許多和陳姐姐一樣的好人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你太亂來了，詩懷雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯，哦哦哦，好好好，知道了知道了，為什麼我非得被你教訓不可！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "現在近衛局可以說就是交在你的手裡，你卻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哎呀，我自己有數的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你才是，明明是跑羅德島當幹員，結果卻偷偷跑這裡來度假！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我這是......算了，你說得也沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "接著吵啊，怎麼停了，老陳走了之後，你們上次吵架感覺都不知道是什麼時候的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我上次去羅德島的時候還是吵過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎呀，總之，來都來了，事情也都解決了，我們還是把一些不愉快給忘掉，然後好好地玩一玩才是正經事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "對吧，老陳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "哈......也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎麼了，還在想昨天的事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "是。呵，這可能是我這輩子收到的最不想要的榮譽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，確實，老實說，就算是我，也覺得夠噁心人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但是它就是發生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳，世上可沒有那麼多兩全其美和稱心如意的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "行了行了，比起坐著聊天，不如出去購物吃大餐才能提起精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "走了，中午本小姐請客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "那隻死老鼠去哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "她好像一大早就出去了，但是不知道去哪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我大概知道，我去找她吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "找到了記得告訴我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哼，昨晚開始就躲著我，等我找到她，她死定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我離開後，這裡就交給你打理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "教給你的那些沒忘吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賭場老闆",
      "text": "當然，您放一百個心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你們在聊什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賭場老闆",
      "text": "啊，是陳小姐，大姐頭正在給我們訓話呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "別跟她扯這個，小心她逮捕你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我已經不是警察了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我可沒見過你這麼多管閒事的遊客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "先下去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賭場老闆",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "找我有什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我想，你應該不會是主動找我來喝酒的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "如果我說是呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那......喝一杯也可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我知道的龍門青年創業者協會會長，是個雷厲風行，對自己和他人都很嚴格的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這一次，算是見識到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "而我知道的龍門近衛局特別督察組組長，是個鐵面無私，對罪犯毫不留情的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "這一次，也算是領教了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這次是魏彥吾讓你來的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "是文月夫人讓我代表魏長官來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我一開始不理解，看到你就理解了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......你不生氣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不生氣，這對我而言是個機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鼠王的女兒未必是鼠王，但也可以是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "所以你才幫他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......我不會告訴你答案的，陳暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "因為我和你不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你想說我拋棄了龍門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "一開始是有點這個意思，現在沒有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "這只是陳述句，我和你不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "聽著還是刺耳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那是你的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "喂，你找到死老鼠沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "她就在旁邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你們現在在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "26號沿海公路的一家酒吧裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "26號？那正好，我看到有家很不錯的店也在那裡，我把地址發給你，你們先過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "給我把那隻死老鼠也拖上，她別想跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你也聽到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......唉，這個女人還是這麼麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "沙灘那邊的人真多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "畢竟這座城市的象徵之一，那艘遊輪就那麼沉了，總會有許多人好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那艘遊輪......呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不管你怎麼想，那艘遊輪是我們炸掉的，這是事實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士同意用我們的獎金來抵消已經是謝天謝地了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "確切地說，是你炸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你有更好的方法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "嗯？那邊的是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "埃內斯托？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "陳小姐，林小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你怎麼在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士饒了父親以外的其他人一命，大部分人都被放逐了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士念在我這幾年的功勞上，允許我留下，當然，我的工作肯定是沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你打算留下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "不，我打算離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我和拉菲艾拉在猶豫去哪裡，我從昨晚想到現在也想不出一個所以然，就在這裡看著海發呆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "拉菲艾拉是那個小姑娘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "是的，她是父親戰友皮尤的女兒，皮尤叔叔為了把父親從監獄裡救出來而死，死前把她託付給了父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "兩位有沒有考慮過現在把我就地解決掉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我還沒有資格來審判你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "如果你成功了，再讓我遇到你，我會殺了你。現在......就算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "哈哈，真是有兩位風格的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "......陳小姐，林小姐，用炎國的話來說，我這樣已經是大不孝了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "雖然也有大義滅親的說法，不過你算不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "哈哈哈，確實，我可沒有什麼大義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "不過至少，在這一次行動的過程中，我沒有想過背叛父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我在船上對陳小姐你說的那些話，並不是謊言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我不知道兩位這段時間在這裡生活有沒有這樣的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我清楚地知道這座城市建立在什麼之上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "但是，當我看到這些高樓大廈，這片碧波藍天的時候，我還是會不由自主地覺得它是對的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我想不出除此以外的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......但你選擇離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "老實說，其實如果不是兩位的出現，我覺得我一定會從此甘願成為坎黛拉女士的手下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "但是，陳小姐你對我說的那些話，又讓我產生了迷茫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "兩位來自其他國家，說不定，在其他地方，有不同的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "......呼，和兩位說完之後，感覺舒服了一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "感謝兩位沒有見面就把我解決掉，還聽我說了這麼多廢話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "立場不同而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我就不繼續打擾兩位了，我應該還會在這座城市停留一段時間，要是有用得到我的地方，請儘管找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......我幫不了他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我也......你的意思是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我只是覺得讓他就這麼下去有些可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......我會考慮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "喂，老陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你們來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "text": "我們正好從市政府出來，詩小姐把我們也一起叫上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "原來如此。和市長談得如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "text": "沾了你們的光，我們也算是對這次事件有貢獻，市長想都沒想就同意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "確實是有那位的風格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "死老鼠，終於讓我抓到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我又沒跑。反倒是你，你是不是腦子有病，詩懷雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你才腦子有病！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "一般人會因為嫉妒朋友出去玩而自己也跟上，而且到了地方還躲著對方的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "本小姐樂意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "對了，Missy說下午要一起去購物，順便買土產，老陳，林小姐，飯後一起？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "死老鼠不准不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "好吧，反正我也沒什麼特別的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "那我們先去吃飯吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "text": "四位，來，稍微擺一下pose。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "text": "我忽然覺得這一幕很適合拍成照片，我來給你們拍一張，作為這次度假的紀念吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "好啊好啊，喂，死老鼠，要拍照了，趕緊站好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......唉，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，我們四個聚在一起倒也確實是難得的機會，那就拍一張吧，老陳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "text": "那麼，三，二，一，茄子——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你在看雨霞寫的有關這次多索雷斯之行的報告？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "對。許久沒有見到坎黛拉，這個女人看來還是老樣子，瘋瘋癲癲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你敢說你和她不一樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "我和她當然不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "我聽派去的信使說，雨霞和小陳，這次好像做得很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "雖然不知道為什麼詩懷雅家大小姐和星熊也去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "她們兩個確實做得很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "但我想，她們自己不會很高興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "你說坎黛拉不會害她們，我同意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "但坎黛拉這個女人的善意，我恐怕她們還不知道該怎麼去承受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "對這個女人來說，沒有大是大非，只有結果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "所以你還是拐彎抹角想說我一開始不該送小陳和雨霞過去是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "不，恰好相反，你說得對，見一見，沒有壞處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "哎喲，難得你也會說些好話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "既然這樣，給你看個好東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "雨霞帶回來的一張照片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "看，年輕真好，一個個都有活力得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "我們也有過那樣的時光，你還記得吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "我當然記得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "看到小陳過得好，我也就放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "這張照片我要去裱起來，好好收藏起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "你高興就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "彥吾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你說，小陳還會回來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "她會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
